msgstr "Ami「Estuvo pasable.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just alright?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Solo pasable?」"

msgid "Ami「You could make it yourself, couldn't＿you?」"
msgstr "Ami「Tú mismo podrías prepararlo, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tal vez?」"

msgid "Ami「You should give it a shot.」"
msgstr "Ami「Deberías intentarlo.」"

